OL,3,ABurnham brands ban on football fans
OL,4,Adrinking alcohol in stands as
OL,5,A'discrimination'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Football Supporters' Association
OL,8,F(FSA) said the "outdated" legislation
OL,9,Fshould be reviewed, but police chiefs
OL,10,Fhave warned against relaxing the law
OL,11,Fand would like to meet the PM to
OL,12,F"explain the challenges".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/38
